# Source-only repository. New files require explicit review before inclusion.
# Existing local discussions, personal data, workspaces, credentials, caches,
# browser profiles, screenshots and generated validation output stay untracked.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
/.github/*
!/.github/README.md
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/design/
/docs/design/*
!/docs/design/requirements.md
!/prototypes/
/prototypes/*
!/prototypes/lifetime-experience/
/prototypes/lifetime-experience/*
!/prototypes/lifetime-experience/index.html
!/prototypes/lifetime-experience/validate.mjs
